Package: bc250-dashboard
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Yann HALLOUARD <yann.hal@gmail.com>
Depends: libc6, libudev1, init-system-helpers
Recommends: mangohud
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: TURZX 3.5" USB panel — boot animation + live system dashboard
 Drives a TURZX / Turing 3.5" (320x480) USB-C secondary screen: a minimal-motion
 boot animation, then a permanent GPU / CPU / VRAM / FPS / temperature dashboard
 fed by sysfs, nvidia-smi and MangoHud's CSV log. Dirty-region rendering keeps
 the panel writes tiny.
 .
 Ships a systemd --user unit; after install run
 `systemctl --user enable --now bc250-dashboard` (and `loginctl enable-linger`
 to start it at boot before login).
